  "solution": "Given equation: 83 + 711 – 95 ÷ 9 × 2 = 20\n\n1. 9 and 2\n\n83 + 711 – **__95 ÷ 2__** × 9 = 20\n\n⇒ 83 + 711 – **__47.5__****__ × 9__** = 20\n\n⇒ **__83 + 711__ **– 427.5 = 20\n\n⇒ __794** **____**– **____**427.5**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 366.5 ≠ 20\n\n**2. 711 and 95**\n\n**83 + 95 – __711 ÷ 9__ × 2 = 20**\n\n**⇒ 83 + 95 – __79 × 2__ = 20**\n\n**⇒ __83 + 95__ – 158 = 20**\n\n**⇒ __178 - 158__ = 20**\n\n**⇒ 20 = 20**\n\n3. 95 and 83\n\n95 + 711 – **__83 ÷ 9__** × 2 = 20\n\n⇒ 95 + 711 – **__9.22__**__ **× 2**__ = 20\n\n⇒ **__95 + 711__** – 18.44 = 20\n\n⇒ **__806 __****__– 18.44__** = 20\n\n⇒ 787.56 ≠ 20\n\n4. 2 and 83\n\n2 + 711 – __**95 ÷ 9**__ × 83 = 20\n\n⇒ 2 + 711 – **__10.55 × 83__** = 20\n\n⇒ __**2 + 711**__ – 875.65 = 20\n\n⇒ __**713 **____**– 875.65**__ = 20\n\n⇒ -162.65 ≠ 20\n\nHence, '**711 and 95**' is the correct answer.",
